  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "The forward process defines a noisy state: x_t = \u221A\u03B1\u0304_t
    x_0 + \u221A(1\u2212\u03B1\u0304_t)\u03B5, with \u03B5 sampled from a standard
    normal distribution. During training, the model sees x_t, time t, and a digit
    label, then learns to predict \u03B5. Generation starts from Gaussian noise instead
    of a known image and repeatedly uses the predicted noise to estimate a clean
    image and the next state. The changing pictures and values come from this model's
    live GPU textures."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
