  m_text: 'Noise and image share one latent space.

    U-Net predicts noise conditioned
    on CLIP.

    CFG combines prompt and negative predictions.

    DDIM removes
    noise step by step.

    VAE maps 4 latent channels into RGB.

    INT8 bytes
    + INT32 MAC; norms and softmax use float.'
